<title>BERMUDA: Republic exercises warrant to buy ADT shrs.</title>
<headline>Republic exercises warrant to buy ADT shrs.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, Bermuda 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Republic Industries Inc is exercising its warrant to buy 15 million common shares or 9.6 percent of ADT Ltd at $20 each, ADT said Friday.  </p>
<p>ADT provides electronic security services, while Republic operates security services.</p>
<p>Western Resources Inc and Tyco International Ltd are engaged in a bidding war over ADT.</p>
</text>
